{
  "id": 8859736867015,
  "title": "Personalized Mosaic Tree of Life Quilt Sets, Machine Wa - Mosaic Style",
  "handle": "personalized-mosaic-tree-of-life-quilt-sets-machine-wa-mosaic-style",
  "body_html": "<p>Embrace the symbolic beauty of the Yggdrasil Tree of Life with this exquisite quilt set from Jeminise. Designed to offer both comfort and a profound message of resilience and interconnectedness, this quilt set is perfect for enhancing your home decor or as a thoughtful gift for loved ones.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Amazing Yggdrasil Quilt Design:</strong> Features the iconic Tree of Life, symbolizing resilience, strength, and interconnectedness.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Choose from 5 sizes: Throw (60x70 inches), Twin (68x86 inches), Full (80x90 inches), Queen (90x90 inches), and King (91x102 inches).</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Professional Design:</strong> Crafted with specially designed colorful themes on smooth material, perfect for both decorative and functional use.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Thoughtful Gift:</strong> An ideal and practical present for housewarmings, weddings, holidays, or any special occasion for family and friends.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water, microfibers dry quickly and fluffier than before.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> This set includes 1 quilt, with an optional pillowcase for some sizes.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Perfect for indoor and outdoor use, providing warmth in all seasons, suitable for beds, sofas, camping, and picnics.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Sets</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polycotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Cotton, Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Colorful Tree of Life</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Tree of Life</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Tree of Life</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Minimalist</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>1 Quilt + Pillowcase (Optional)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>1 text input</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Throw(60x70 inches)| Twin(68x86 inches)| Full(80x90 inches)| Queen (90x90 inches)| King (91x102 inches)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
